{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Painted Echoes is a puzzle game about matching a room's colors to a reference photograph.\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671550/extras/223ff0a1354041f6488b3a4b45284345.avif?t=1749165123\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671550/extras_big/223ff0a1354041f6488b3a4b45284345.avif?t=1749165123 width=800 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room starts with mismatched colors on objects. Absorb colors with your paintbrush and apply them to the correct object. Transform the room to match the original layout.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb and apply colors to objects throughout each room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find photographs to uncover what the room looks like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine colors to create new colors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rearrange furniture to the correct spot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3671550?t=1749165123","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3671550?t=1749165123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671550/84e56d25b5390b5934e6b8c5289a5dad417e94c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749165123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671550/84e56d25b5390b5934e6b8c5289a5dad417e94c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749165123","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Painted Echoes is a puzzle game about matching a room's colors t